(906898, 104868, 8624, '<td valign="top">you need to check your monitor - I can see a big black editing blob around the middle lit candle where I assume you tried to remove some part of the image. The rest of the background may have looked completely black to you, but I clearly see this, which completely distracts from an otherwise nicely composed image</td>', 'you need to check your monitor - I can see a big black editing blob around the middle lit candle where I assume you tried to remove some part of the image. The rest of the background may have looked completely black to you, but I clearly see this, which completely distracts from an otherwise nicely composed image', '2004-09-13 02:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
