(907188, 104684, 8643, '<td valign="top">I think it was a pity to centre the two planes - cropping to put them in the top left thirds would maybe improve - like the idea.</td>', 'I think it was a pity to centre the two planes - cropping to put them in the top left thirds would maybe improve - like the idea.', '2004-09-13 06:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(907193, 105133, 10170, '<td valign="top">*laugh*  Just too funny, and what a wonderful model you have there :)  Great stuff, this really has a certain something and real character :)</td>', '*laugh*  Just too funny, and what a wonderful model you have there :)  Great stuff, this really has a certain something and real character :)', '2004-09-13 06:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(907197, 104688, 10170, '<td valign="top">Sensational, just love it.  Second photo I pick as a ribbon winner, though could not even guess the order.  Great stuff.  10</td>', 'Sensational, just love it.  Second photo I pick as a ribbon winner, though could not even guess the order.  Great stuff.  10', '2004-09-13 06:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(907219, 104853, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is very lovely.  the composition is very nice and the sharpness and detail of the smoke is excellent.  colours are also a strong point - deceptively monotone, but isn''t.  i might have tried pulling the candle away from the wall a little bit (to reduce the proximity of the shadow), brought the candle a tiny bit more in focus, and to be honest,  the border doesn''t really improve the overall appearance.  on the whole though it''s a lovely shot, and the smoke is especially well done.  it''s also a very stylish submission.  7.</td>', 'this is very lovely.  the composition is very nice and the sharpness and detail of the smoke is excellent.  colours are also a strong point - deceptively monotone, but isn''t.  i might have tried pulling the candle away from the wall a little bit (to reduce the proximity of the shadow), brought the candle a tiny bit more in focus, and to be honest,  the border doesn''t really improve the overall appearance.  on the whole though it''s a lovely shot, and the smoke is especially well done.  it''s also a very stylish submission.  7.', '2004-09-13 06:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(907256, 104876, 15497, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, a tad over burned maybe.. But where is the smoke?</td>', 'Very nice picture, a tad over burned maybe.. But where is the smoke?', '2004-09-13 07:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(907262, 104876, 16004, '<td valign="top">it was a terrible film, but this strongly reminds me of independence day (big spaceships etc).  in terms of the quality of the shot, this is fantastic.  the sky - obviously the focus of the shot, is both dramatic and beautiful.  the little boat is a nice touch, that definitely adds to the overall feel.  choice of black and white (well, greys and white, really) is also very nice.  problem with the 21st century is that, unlike the wonderful days of where the burning coal and oil in the middle of cities was rife, the burning of clean fuels, even diesel, produces a very clear kind of smog.   consequently, title aside, it''s hard to see why this fits this particular challenge.  it''s still a wonderful shot, very poster-esque.  can''t give you more than a 7 though.  sorry.</td>', 'it was a terrible film, but this strongly reminds me of independence day (big spaceships etc).  in terms of the quality of the shot, this is fantastic.  the sky - obviously the focus of the shot, is both dramatic and beautiful.  the little boat is a nice touch, that definitely adds to the overall feel.  choice of black and white (well, greys and white, really) is also very nice.  problem with the 21st century is that, unlike the wonderful days of where the burning coal and oil in the middle of cities was rife, the burning of clean fuels, even diesel, produces a very clear kind of smog.   consequently, title aside, it''s hard to see why this fits this particular challenge.  it''s still a wonderful shot, very poster-esque.  can''t give you more than a 7 though.  sorry.', '2004-09-13 07:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(907280, 104666, 16493, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good lighting, suffers from a bad crop.<br/>scull too centerd - better to crop more of the left side.</td>', 'Good idea, good lighting, suffers from a bad crop.scull too centerd - better to crop more of the left side.', '2004-09-13 08:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(907401, 104916, 1368, '<td valign="top">I bet there is still a stink in that room :)  nice colors and composition maybe a bit too much light from the right</td>', 'I bet there is still a stink in that room :)  nice colors and composition maybe a bit too much light from the right', '2004-09-13 09:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(907402, 104876, 24459, '<td valign="top">For me there is no smoke here. You say there was smog, I can only see clound. Plus it''s a bit tilted. The composition is also not the best</td>', 'For me there is no smoke here. You say there was smog, I can only see clound. Plus it''s a bit tilted. The composition is also not the best', '2004-09-13 09:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(907408, 104600, 24459, '<td valign="top">The smoke changed to fog unfortunatelly. The quality is a bit poor.</td>', 'The smoke changed to fog unfortunatelly. The quality is a bit poor.', '2004-09-13 10:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(907411, 105051, 24546, '<td valign="top">This was a neat idea. I really like the shapes I see in the smoke.  But it is too blurred.  I tried some smoke photos and found them very hard to do. My best guess is that you used too long an exposure for this one.</td>', 'This was a neat idea. I really like the shapes I see in the smoke.  But it is too blurred.  I tried some smoke photos and found them very hard to do. My best guess is that you used too long an exposure for this one.', '2004-09-13 10:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(907415, 104684, 24459, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the composition could have been much better</td>', 'I''m sure the composition could have been much better', '2004-09-13 10:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(907417, 104490, 1368, '<td valign="top">Amazing :)  Beautiful!</td>', 'Amazing :)  Beautiful!', '2004-09-13 10:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(907428, 104564, 24546, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, but this looks like mist - not smoke.</td>', 'Lovely photo, but this looks like mist - not smoke.', '2004-09-13 10:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
