(907448, 104876, 24546, '<td valign="top">I think smog shows up better in color - it is so  obviously yellow and brown rather than fog which is white or gray.  This looks more like clouds to me.  Another technical point on this photo - your water line is not level.</td>', 'I think smog shows up better in color - it is so  obviously yellow and brown rather than fog which is white or gray.  This looks more like clouds to me.  Another technical point on this photo - your water line is not level.', '2004-09-13 10:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
