(908423, 104803, 8624, '<td valign="top">really well composed. the lighting on the bottom of the hands is a bit too bright and blown out, but the rest of the image is so nicely done. congrats.</td>', 'really well composed. the lighting on the bottom of the hands is a bit too bright and blown out, but the rest of the image is so nicely done. congrats.', '2004-09-13 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
