(910033, 104850, 23338, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...  not done rating yet, but isn''t that the same drive that mirrored the DPChallenge forum page in the Mirrors challenge?  It sure is getting lots of attention these days...  Would hate to see it crash.   My first impression is: pretty drive, nice image, neat play between gold reflections and red colors - oh, and there IS some smoke there.</td>', 'Hmmm...  not done rating yet, but isn''t that the same drive that mirrored the DPChallenge forum page in the Mirrors challenge?  It sure is getting lots of attention these days...  Would hate to see it crash.   My first impression is: pretty drive, nice image, neat play between gold reflections and red colors - oh, and there IS some smoke there.', '2004-09-14 22:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(910041, 105022, 23338, '<td valign="top">I think I would have rated this higher, but the smoke appears so indistinct and out of focus.  Was it blowing away from the camera?  Wish the bottom edges of the smoke were not cropped out.  The candle is so distinct and clear that it tends to detract from the swirling images of smoke.   Just my thoughts.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I think I would have rated this higher, but the smoke appears so indistinct and out of focus.  Was it blowing away from the camera?  Wish the bottom edges of the smoke were not cropped out.  The candle is so distinct and clear that it tends to detract from the swirling images of smoke.   Just my thoughts.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 22:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(910043, 104801, 23338, '<td valign="top">This image strikes me as much more about fire and not much about smoke.  But, really amazing capture of some flames, isn''t it!  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This image strikes me as much more about fire and not much about smoke.  But, really amazing capture of some flames, isn''t it!  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 22:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(910060, 105133, 23338, '<td valign="top">That''s too cute!  Been there, done that, and watched my kids do it, too.  I tend to judge high on "artsey" images, so normally I would have rated this lower, with a 5 or even 4, due to comedic content.  However, I just couldn''t.  It really hit a cord with me - not to ignore the fact that you were so creative and probably worked very hard to set it up.  Hope you do well in the challenge.  :-)</td>', 'That''s too cute!  Been there, done that, and watched my kids do it, too.  I tend to judge high on "artsey" images, so normally I would have rated this lower, with a 5 or even 4, due to comedic content.  However, I just couldn''t.  It really hit a cord with me - not to ignore the fact that you were so creative and probably worked very hard to set it up.  Hope you do well in the challenge.  :-)', '2004-09-14 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(910062, 105072, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of three with colors.  Pushed it way up in my ratings.  Nicely lit and focused.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Nice composition of three with colors.  Pushed it way up in my ratings.  Nicely lit and focused.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-14 22:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(910065, 104430, 23338, '<td valign="top">You know, this image worked on me in strange ways.  I voted lots of images down because of little emphasis on smoke (more fire than smoke, etc.).  But, this image is in an overall sense very well balanced, both in composition and in colors and contrasts.  It''s a really well put together image.  And then ...  you start looking at the smoke ... and it IS doing really strange and wonderful things, isn''t it?  And it''s all in focus (the smoke is).  So, I bumped it way up in my ratings.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'You know, this image worked on me in strange ways.  I voted lots of images down because of little emphasis on smoke (more fire than smoke, etc.).  But, this image is in an overall sense very well balanced, both in composition and in colors and contrasts.  It''s a really well put together image.  And then ...  you start looking at the smoke ... and it IS doing really strange and wonderful things, isn''t it?  And it''s all in focus (the smoke is).  So, I bumped it way up in my ratings.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-14 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(910092, 105106, 17890, '<td valign="top">I love this!  It made me laugh.  The colors are bright and the picture is clear.  I am sorry though, I don''t understand the word "Cohiba".</td>', 'I love this!  It made me laugh.  The colors are bright and the picture is clear.  I am sorry though, I don''t understand the word "Cohiba".', '2004-09-14 22:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
