(911196, 104497, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple shot, good silhouette and great use of negative space.<br/> <br/>The flame looks really good, nice anc clear.  Well done!  Full marks!</td>', 'Nice and simple shot, good silhouette and great use of negative space. The flame looks really good, nice anc clear.  Well done!  Full marks!', '2004-09-15 10:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
