(911364, 104853, 16917, '<td valign="top">i love the idea and the focus but the slight dip in the background gives an uneven tone to the background and distracts from the rest of the photo (7)</td>', 'i love the idea and the focus but the slight dip in the background gives an uneven tone to the background and distracts from the rest of the photo (7)', '2004-09-15 12:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(911365, 105004, 16917, '<td valign="top">slightly spooky but nicely shot/composed</td>', 'slightly spooky but nicely shot/composed', '2004-09-15 12:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(911397, 104776, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. color, contrast, focus, DOF and composition are all perfect. (10)</td>', 'Beautifully done. color, contrast, focus, DOF and composition are all perfect. (10)', '2004-09-15 12:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(911400, 103484, 18197, '<td valign="top">Innovative idea well executed. Background and lighting are superb at highlighting the subject. Contrast works well. Focus and DOf are spot on. Interest ing composition. (10) Wondering how many light bulbs it took to catch the moment?</td>', 'Innovative idea well executed. Background and lighting are superb at highlighting the subject. Contrast works well. Focus and DOf are spot on. Interest ing composition. (10) Wondering how many light bulbs it took to catch the moment?', '2004-09-15 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(911403, 104655, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the action of this shot. Technically good (focus, DOF, color, contrast, composition - although it feels a little bit weighted down on the left). Among my top picks.</td>', 'I like the action of this shot. Technically good (focus, DOF, color, contrast, composition - although it feels a little bit weighted down on the left). Among my top picks.', '2004-09-15 12:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(911404, 104396, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Smoke isn''t as dramatic as some other shots in the challenge but including the candles and lighting just their tops makes for a stronger composition. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Nicely done. Smoke isn''t as dramatic as some other shots in the challenge but including the candles and lighting just their tops makes for a stronger composition. Among my top picks.', '2004-09-15 12:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(911411, 105067, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. It seems you have rotated the photo 90 degrres to the right which makes for an interesting composition and creates a greater sense of motion. Good idea and well executed. B&amp;W works well.  Virtually perfect capture technically. There is one little wisp of smoke I might have cloned out ... sort of a horizontal one at the top just to right of center ... but it''s only a minor distraction. Among my top picks.</td>', 'This is excellent. It seems you have rotated the photo 90 degrres to the right which makes for an interesting composition and creates a greater sense of motion. Good idea and well executed. B&W works well.  Virtually perfect capture technically. There is one little wisp of smoke I might have cloned out ... sort of a horizontal one at the top just to right of center ... but it''s only a minor distraction. Among my top picks.', '2004-09-15 12:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(911413, 104908, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the transparency of the smoke. The high contrast against the light background works well. It''s a little busy at the top but that''s only a minor distraction. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the transparency of the smoke. The high contrast against the light background works well. It''s a little busy at the top but that''s only a minor distraction. Among my top picks.', '2004-09-15 12:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(911420, 104253, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that this is a more complex image of smoke than some of the other shots. The red of the candel is nice and lends a reality to the shot that some of the others don''t have. Well done -- among my top picks.</td>', 'I like the fact that this is a more complex image of smoke than some of the other shots. The red of the candel is nice and lends a reality to the shot that some of the others don''t have. Well done -- among my top picks.', '2004-09-15 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(911428, 104734, 18197, '<td valign="top">Powerful image well captured.  Also a risky shot: 1) Not a "feel good" shot which DPC voters tend to prefer; and 2) On the borderline regarding encouraging under age tobacco use. You will lose points with some voters because there''s not much smoke. But all that aside, this is one of my top picks this challenge!  Well done. A ribbon contender from my perspective.</td>', 'Powerful image well captured.  Also a risky shot: 1) Not a "feel good" shot which DPC voters tend to prefer; and 2) On the borderline regarding encouraging under age tobacco use. You will lose points with some voters because there''s not much smoke. But all that aside, this is one of my top picks this challenge!  Well done. A ribbon contender from my perspective.', '2004-09-15 12:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(911541, 104655, 24613, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Especially like the way you caught the blast of that weapon being fired.  I really like this one alot!  Had to come back and say it is for sure my favorite.  10</td>', 'Excellent!  Especially like the way you caught the blast of that weapon being fired.  I really like this one alot!  Had to come back and say it is for sure my favorite.  10', '2004-09-15 14:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
