(911878, 104611, 13026, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked it better if it had been cropped closer, so the backround was not as distracting.</td>', 'I would''ve liked it better if it had been cropped closer, so the backround was not as distracting.', '2004-09-15 17:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
