(911949, 104799, 23653, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I think a frame would be nice.....9</td>', 'Very nice shot, I think a frame would be nice.....9', '2004-09-15 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(911957, 104940, 23653, '<td valign="top">Really nice...7</td>', 'Really nice...7', '2004-09-15 18:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(911964, 105014, 16912, '<td valign="top">Love it, sharp yet smooth and perfectly fits the challenge :) I have this down for a ribbon and would love to know how you created this effect.<br/>On the web I think you have the right crop to show the detail in the smoke, as a print I''d like to see a little more space on the sides and top</td>', 'Love it, sharp yet smooth and perfectly fits the challenge :) I have this down for a ribbon and would love to know how you created this effect.On the web I think you have the right crop to show the detail in the smoke, as a print I''d like to see a little more space on the sides and top', '2004-09-15 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(911966, 105034, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - a very interesting take on the challenge.  You''ve added a lot of noise - which adds a lot for me - it was a great touch.  But, unfortunately, the very over exposed areas on the right side of your model''s face detract a lot, cancelling out the extra points you would have gotten for the noise.  It seems this may have been taken in low light, making the models pupils rather dialated - another nice effect.  Overall, I''d guess this will score above the middle - but not make it into the very top.  Some won''t like the noise.</td>', 'Ah - a very interesting take on the challenge.  You''ve added a lot of noise - which adds a lot for me - it was a great touch.  But, unfortunately, the very over exposed areas on the right side of your model''s face detract a lot, cancelling out the extra points you would have gotten for the noise.  It seems this may have been taken in low light, making the models pupils rather dialated - another nice effect.  Overall, I''d guess this will score above the middle - but not make it into the very top.  Some won''t like the noise.', '2004-09-15 18:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(911970, 103484, 16912, '<td valign="top">Of course, there is a blow by blow tutorial being written now? along with several out takes lol.<br/> <br/>Ecellent shot and I''ve selected 2 of the ribbons :)</td>', 'Of course, there is a blow by blow tutorial being written now? along with several out takes lol. Ecellent shot and I''ve selected 2 of the ribbons :)', '2004-09-15 18:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(911982, 104908, 16912, '<td valign="top">Not suprised validation was requested (not that it would have altered my score).  The detail and smoothness of this shot is quite stunning.<br/> <br/>There are a couple of ''spots''  that could maybe have been cleaned up. I hope you let us all in on your secret to success?</td>', 'Not suprised validation was requested (not that it would have altered my score).  The detail and smoothness of this shot is quite stunning. There are a couple of ''spots''  that could maybe have been cleaned up. I hope you let us all in on your secret to success?', '2004-09-15 18:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(911989, 104776, 16912, '<td valign="top">Excellent, the colour in this really adds to the overall atmosphere, I love it and would love to know the source of the smoke - am sure you''ll explain it all at the end of the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent, the colour in this really adds to the overall atmosphere, I love it and would love to know the source of the smoke - am sure you''ll explain it all at the end of the challenge.', '2004-09-15 18:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(911997, 105005, 16912, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I can almost read the thouhts of these two guys.<br/> <br/>I know this is the smoke challenge but as a stand alone portrait (another time) without the smoker this would be awesome.</td>', 'Excellent shot. I can almost read the thouhts of these two guys. I know this is the smoke challenge but as a stand alone portrait (another time) without the smoker this would be awesome.', '2004-09-15 19:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(912031, 105067, 16912, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and I like the rotation.  Nice and sharp whilst holding the softeness of swirling smoke. Would it have been possible to have created/kept some white space on the right?<br/>Not sure if you are a vote watcher but if you are that 1 jou just got was me bumbing you up a point :)</td>', 'Very nice, and I like the rotation.  Nice and sharp whilst holding the softeness of swirling smoke. Would it have been possible to have created/kept some white space on the right?Not sure if you are a vote watcher but if you are that 1 jou just got was me bumbing you up a point :)', '2004-09-15 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(912034, 104490, 16912, '<td valign="top">Very nice, it looks to as if maybe it could be rotated to the left a degree or so the strighten the foreground? Matted and in a decent frame this would be awesome (reminds me ofthe Ince-B terminal close to where I was brought up).</td>', 'Very nice, it looks to as if maybe it could be rotated to the left a degree or so the strighten the foreground? Matted and in a decent frame this would be awesome (reminds me ofthe Ince-B terminal close to where I was brought up).', '2004-09-15 19:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(912046, 104324, 23338, '<td valign="top">This image is so strange and stark and it raises such negative emotions in me.  I hate cigarette smoke and the taste of someone that smokes; I love a good image.  The image is so detailed, in focus, creative and wild - the lips seem suspended in mid-air; the bubble seems so wet; the smoke seems so trapped.  The obvious photographic quality pushed me over to the positive side of the ratings in a tug-of-war between my conflicting emotions.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This image is so strange and stark and it raises such negative emotions in me.  I hate cigarette smoke and the taste of someone that smokes; I love a good image.  The image is so detailed, in focus, creative and wild - the lips seem suspended in mid-air; the bubble seems so wet; the smoke seems so trapped.  The obvious photographic quality pushed me over to the positive side of the ratings in a tug-of-war between my conflicting emotions.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-15 19:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(912055, 104600, 23338, '<td valign="top">This image lacks any esthetically pleasing smoke, just a general "haze" atop a scene formed with play characters.   A nice view for an elementary school display box; not the quality necessary for really nice photographic art.  I''d redirect my efforts toward concentrating on the smoke itself - maybe something abstract.  But, hey.  That''s just me and my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This image lacks any esthetically pleasing smoke, just a general "haze" atop a scene formed with play characters.   A nice view for an elementary school display box; not the quality necessary for really nice photographic art.  I''d redirect my efforts toward concentrating on the smoke itself - maybe something abstract.  But, hey.  That''s just me and my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-15 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(912069, 104652, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ok, after multiple viewings the last few days, I''m starting to get it.  Exhaust pipe and smoke coming out, right?  My apologies - I don''t mean for that to sound sarcastic.  I just had problems "seeing" what you saw.   I do like the portrayal of the pipe; I don''t really like the smoke - it seems to lack character.   If it were my image, I''d probably try to do a black background on the left (which would still contrast nicely with the pipe), highlight the smoke, and try quite a few shots until something with more attractive "wisps" came out.  That would also require me to push the pipe to the right in order to emphasize the smoke ... but, as I''ve said to others, "Hey, that''s just me."  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, after multiple viewings the last few days, I''m starting to get it.  Exhaust pipe and smoke coming out, right?  My apologies - I don''t mean for that to sound sarcastic.  I just had problems "seeing" what you saw.   I do like the portrayal of the pipe; I don''t really like the smoke - it seems to lack character.   If it were my image, I''d probably try to do a black background on the left (which would still contrast nicely with the pipe), highlight the smoke, and try quite a few shots until something with more attractive "wisps" came out.  That would also require me to push the pipe to the right in order to emphasize the smoke ... but, as I''ve said to others, "Hey, that''s just me."  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-15 19:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(912073, 104752, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good title, good lighting and cropping.</td>', 'Good title, good lighting and cropping.', '2004-09-15 19:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(912074, 104846, 23338, '<td valign="top">I know, there''s lots of smoke there.  However, it seems very subdued, out of focus and hidden.  It is fun to capture, and assumes great shapes, but I''d try to capture it with more lighting - something that has to come from additional fireworks.  Although I''ve taken similar images, I haven''t concentrated on this particular type as a study.  For ME, I would start with a tripod, multiple shots over 15 minutes, concentrate on focusing, and look for the smoke cloud photo lit up by a mass of spectacular fireworks.  Don''t know what I''d get, and I do commend you for the effort.  (Wordy, aren''t I.)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I know, there''s lots of smoke there.  However, it seems very subdued, out of focus and hidden.  It is fun to capture, and assumes great shapes, but I''d try to capture it with more lighting - something that has to come from additional fireworks.  Although I''ve taken similar images, I haven''t concentrated on this particular type as a study.  For ME, I would start with a tripod, multiple shots over 15 minutes, concentrate on focusing, and look for the smoke cloud photo lit up by a mass of spectacular fireworks.  Don''t know what I''d get, and I do commend you for the effort.  (Wordy, aren''t I.)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-15 19:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(912078, 105068, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very appealing abstract quality.  Good cropping and the contrasting colors between the fire and the smoke are brilliant.</td>', 'Very appealing abstract quality.  Good cropping and the contrasting colors between the fire and the smoke are brilliant.', '2004-09-15 19:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(912084, 105004, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, strong shot. Perhaps a more gray tone in the border would help?</td>', 'Good lighting, strong shot. Perhaps a more gray tone in the border would help?', '2004-09-15 20:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(912094, 104918, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the smooth tones and simple composition. I find the "horizon" a bit too strong.</td>', 'I like the smooth tones and simple composition. I find the "horizon" a bit too strong.', '2004-09-15 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(912096, 105072, 24642, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but a bit lame title.</td>', 'A nice shot but a bit lame title.', '2004-09-15 20:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(912110, 104070, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good cropping and lighting.  The smoke is rather fuzzy.  I like the border.  A tear would help the title ;-)</td>', 'Good cropping and lighting.  The smoke is rather fuzzy.  I like the border.  A tear would help the title ;-)', '2004-09-15 20:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(912119, 105067, 24642, '<td valign="top">Refreshingly different. I like the cropping and the flow.  Is this a negative?</td>', 'Refreshingly different. I like the cropping and the flow.  Is this a negative?', '2004-09-15 20:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(912123, 104258, 24642, '<td valign="top">A strong shot with a grand title.</td>', 'A strong shot with a grand title.', '2004-09-15 20:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(912131, 104430, 24642, '<td valign="top">I can allmost smell it.  I like the composition and lighting.</td>', 'I can allmost smell it.  I like the composition and lighting.', '2004-09-15 20:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(912139, 105014, 24642, '<td valign="top">Wow this is awesome.</td>', 'Wow this is awesome.', '2004-09-15 20:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(912187, 104666, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but personally I''d have cropped a bit of the negative space off the left hand side.  The skull just seems a bit too centred for my liking.</td>', 'This is a great shot, but personally I''d have cropped a bit of the negative space off the left hand side.  The skull just seems a bit too centred for my liking.', '2004-09-15 21:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(912446, 105073, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I can feel the sunset. Graduated levels of gray along the hills are very nicely leveled. I would have been able to score it higher if there were a more obvious tie-in to the theme.</td>', 'Nice image. I can feel the sunset. Graduated levels of gray along the hills are very nicely leveled. I would have been able to score it higher if there were a more obvious tie-in to the theme.', '2004-09-16 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(912449, 105145, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It''s an interesting image with subtle colors, great focus and decent composition. I would have been able to score it higher if it had a more obvious tie-in to the theme.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It''s an interesting image with subtle colors, great focus and decent composition. I would have been able to score it higher if it had a more obvious tie-in to the theme.', '2004-09-16 00:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(912492, 103484, 23338, '<td valign="top">There''s such vivid detail and sharp contrasts in this image - from the sharp shards of glass to the swirling white loops of cooling smoke.  And it just hangs there and turns in upon itself forming exotic shapes as it twists into future oblivion.  Perfectly lit, perfectly focused - absolutely beautiful.  How can anything so acrid and harmful be so interesting and captivating?  Wonderful image.  Congratulations.  Can''t wait to see how many 10s you get.  Anyone giving it a 1 needs to be drop kicked out of DPC.  :-)</td>', 'There''s such vivid detail and sharp contrasts in this image - from the sharp shards of glass to the swirling white loops of cooling smoke.  And it just hangs there and turns in upon itself forming exotic shapes as it twists into future oblivion.  Perfectly lit, perfectly focused - absolutely beautiful.  How can anything so acrid and harmful be so interesting and captivating?  Wonderful image.  Congratulations.  Can''t wait to see how many 10s you get.  Anyone giving it a 1 needs to be drop kicked out of DPC.  :-)', '2004-09-16 01:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(912495, 105014, 23338, '<td valign="top">You and "Bulb Burner" must have collaberated!  :-)  How could two such similar and fantastically beautiful images have ended up in one challenge?  It makes it so hard on those of us who pride themselves in being able to discern differentiating and distinctive details between comparables in rating images.  I hate to give multiple 10s because I want to pick out the very best one each time and give it the top score.  It''s hard to comprehend that there are multiple images EACH deserving of a 10 or even higher.</td>', 'You and "Bulb Burner" must have collaberated!  :-)  How could two such similar and fantastically beautiful images have ended up in one challenge?  It makes it so hard on those of us who pride themselves in being able to discern differentiating and distinctive details between comparables in rating images.  I hate to give multiple 10s because I want to pick out the very best one each time and give it the top score.  It''s hard to comprehend that there are multiple images EACH deserving of a 10 or even higher.', '2004-09-16 01:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(912496, 104908, 23338, '<td valign="top">Oh, man!  I agree.  You really captured it.  Black smoke against a white background with really net swirls and great contrasts.  Nice focus, too.  The kind of image that you can really spend some time viewing.  Congratulations.  You''re my top rating, so far.</td>', 'Oh, man!  I agree.  You really captured it.  Black smoke against a white background with really net swirls and great contrasts.  Nice focus, too.  The kind of image that you can really spend some time viewing.  Congratulations.  You''re my top rating, so far.', '2004-09-16 01:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(912500, 104776, 23338, '<td valign="top">When I was a little kid, I used to watch smoke from my Dad''s cigarettes.  This reminds me of it.  (I''m surprised that no one took photos of someone blowing smoke circles.)   Anyway, your image is very pretty with the blues and whites against the black background - all nicely composed and focused.  Congratulations and good luck with the image.</td>', 'When I was a little kid, I used to watch smoke from my Dad''s cigarettes.  This reminds me of it.  (I''m surprised that no one took photos of someone blowing smoke circles.)   Anyway, your image is very pretty with the blues and whites against the black background - all nicely composed and focused.  Congratulations and good luck with the image.', '2004-09-16 01:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(912505, 104977, 23338, '<td valign="top">Comparatively little smoke, and not very esthetically pleasing to me.   Understand the word tie in, but that''s not what makes an image really attractive.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Comparatively little smoke, and not very esthetically pleasing to me.   Understand the word tie in, but that''s not what makes an image really attractive.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-16 01:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(912507, 105146, 23338, '<td valign="top">This seems more like the strange creature in the bottom right than it does any smoke in the rest of the image.  To me the smoke needs to be the main subject and really should have more about it that attracts the attention and keeps it.  That''s just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This seems more like the strange creature in the bottom right than it does any smoke in the rest of the image.  To me the smoke needs to be the main subject and really should have more about it that attracts the attention and keeps it.  That''s just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-16 01:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(912509, 104361, 23338, '<td valign="top">My problem with images like this in a challenge on "smoke" is that the image is all about fire.  Not smoke - even though some is obviously there.  But, that''s just me.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'My problem with images like this in a challenge on "smoke" is that the image is all about fire.  Not smoke - even though some is obviously there.  But, that''s just me.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-16 02:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(912510, 104647, 23338, '<td valign="top">We can only hope they burn each other up and can''t show up in future challenges!  :-)  Just kidding.  The could, as with "Mirrors", be in a really great image.   Problem with this image (other than "them") is that it''s about them and the sight gag, not about smoke - even though it exists.  I rated lots of other people lower for the same reason.   Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'We can only hope they burn each other up and can''t show up in future challenges!  :-)  Just kidding.  The could, as with "Mirrors", be in a really great image.   Problem with this image (other than "them") is that it''s about them and the sight gag, not about smoke - even though it exists.  I rated lots of other people lower for the same reason.   Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-16 02:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(912511, 105014, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Is this Kiwiness?</td>', 'Very nice... Is this Kiwiness?', '2004-09-16 02:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(912514, 104853, 5286, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the smioke... Not sure if a plain background wouldn''t help. Also completely desaturating would be better IMO, the red is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice focus on the smioke... Not sure if a plain background wouldn''t help. Also completely desaturating would be better IMO, the red is a little distracting.', '2004-09-16 02:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(912515, 105145, 23338, '<td valign="top">Two images, this one and "Toke", are both similar in that the subject, "smoke", is inside a bottle.  Both, to me, have the same shortcoming: the smoke is very much reduced to a lesser subject position by their container - and to me, the main subject should be "smoke" in order to make it more effective as a "smoke" entry.  But, that''s just my way of looking at it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Two images, this one and "Toke", are both similar in that the subject, "smoke", is inside a bottle.  Both, to me, have the same shortcoming: the smoke is very much reduced to a lesser subject position by their container - and to me, the main subject should be "smoke" in order to make it more effective as a "smoke" entry.  But, that''s just my way of looking at it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-16 02:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(912516, 104819, 5286, '<td valign="top">Funny title, and very nice shot. The little orange at the wick tip is a very nice detail.</td>', 'Funny title, and very nice shot. The little orange at the wick tip is a very nice detail.', '2004-09-16 02:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(912517, 105148, 23338, '<td valign="top">Two images, this one and "Bong Hit", are both similar in that the subject, "smoke", is inside.  Both, to me, have the same shortcoming: the smoke is very much reduced to a lesser subject position by their container - and to me, the main subject should be "smoke" in order to make it more effective as a "smoke" entry.  But, that''s just my way of looking at it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Two images, this one and "Bong Hit", are both similar in that the subject, "smoke", is inside.  Both, to me, have the same shortcoming: the smoke is very much reduced to a lesser subject position by their container - and to me, the main subject should be "smoke" in order to make it more effective as a "smoke" entry.  But, that''s just my way of looking at it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-16 02:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(912527, 104977, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good composition. For whatever reason, the smoke looks kind of fake. I am pretty sure it''s not. There is a fair amount of grain inthe photo. It could be due to slight under exposure.</td>', 'Great idea and good composition. For whatever reason, the smoke looks kind of fake. I am pretty sure it''s not. There is a fair amount of grain inthe photo. It could be due to slight under exposure.', '2004-09-16 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(912538, 104652, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I''m sorry if this seems negative, but here goes ... If the metalic parts were in better focus, I think it would improve the image. I am guessing the dark band on the left is the smoke and hence the subject of the image. If this were better defined and possibly better focused, I also think it would improve the image.  As is, the gold metalic part seems to overpower the photo. Perhaps a little less of that and a little more of the smoke?</td>', 'Interesting idea. I''m sorry if this seems negative, but here goes ... If the metalic parts were in better focus, I think it would improve the image. I am guessing the dark band on the left is the smoke and hence the subject of the image. If this were better defined and possibly better focused, I also think it would improve the image.  As is, the gold metalic part seems to overpower the photo. Perhaps a little less of that and a little more of the smoke?', '2004-09-16 02:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(912559, 104647, 26895, '<td valign="top">LOL... great composition!</td>', 'LOL... great composition!', '2004-09-16 03:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(912644, 105072, 20375, '<td valign="top">Love this shot and would love to know how you did it.<br/>I''m predicting top 10 finish.</td>', 'Love this shot and would love to know how you did it.I''m predicting top 10 finish.', '2004-09-16 04:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(912645, 104920, 23251, '<td valign="top">Pity the bottle wasn''t turned toward the camera a bit more. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Pity the bottle wasn''t turned toward the camera a bit more. Nice idea though.', '2004-09-16 04:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(912646, 104324, 20375, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. Very creative and imaginitive.</td>', 'Love this shot. Very creative and imaginitive.', '2004-09-16 04:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(912647, 104914, 20375, '<td valign="top">The colour in this photo is beautiful.<br/>Well done photo. Meets the challenge. Excellent use of light.</td>', 'The colour in this photo is beautiful.Well done photo. Meets the challenge. Excellent use of light.', '2004-09-16 04:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(912649, 104497, 23251, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you the benifit of the doubt but it really looks like flame!  Maybe colour adjustments could have fixed that for the challenge anyway!</td>', 'I''ll give you the benifit of the doubt but it really looks like flame!  Maybe colour adjustments could have fixed that for the challenge anyway!', '2004-09-16 04:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(912823, 103484, 23251, '<td valign="top">Spactacular photo.  I''m looking forward to finding out how you did this.  My top score this challenge! Ohhh thats a 10</td>', 'Spactacular photo.  I''m looking forward to finding out how you did this.  My top score this challenge! Ohhh thats a 10', '2004-09-16 07:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(912826, 104324, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very smart!  Love the fact that you have done something different.  4 me its a ribbon!  Good luck!</td>', 'Very smart!  Love the fact that you have done something different.  4 me its a ribbon!  Good luck!', '2004-09-16 07:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(912827, 105063, 23251, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I wonder if it could have been possible to show more contrast in the smoke.  That seems to be the only thing it lacks.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I wonder if it could have been possible to show more contrast in the smoke.  That seems to be the only thing it lacks.', '2004-09-16 07:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(912829, 104914, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the window is very distracting 4 me. Maybe at a different angle it could have been cropped out.</td>', 'Great idea but the window is very distracting 4 me. Maybe at a different angle it could have been cropped out.', '2004-09-16 07:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(912841, 104940, 1203, '<td valign="top">fractal<br/></td>', 'fractal', '2004-09-16 08:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
