(912864, 104734, 14614, '<td valign="top">very gritty - good use of b&amp;w and framing to tell a story - like the jusxtaposition (?spelling) of the title and composition - one of my ribbon picks this challenge bol</td>', 'very gritty - good use of b&w and framing to tell a story - like the jusxtaposition (?spelling) of the title and composition - one of my ribbon picks this challenge bol', '2004-09-16 09:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
