(913697, 104688, 16912, '<td valign="top">Slightly confused as to how you got the effect?  I get the smoking ball but the smoke doesn''t give the impression of speed. IMHO if you can remove all the smoke this would be a great shot for a print (challenges don''t really mean that much).<br/> <br/>*vote watcher?*  that last 1 was a bump :)</td>', 'Slightly confused as to how you got the effect?  I get the smoking ball but the smoke doesn''t give the impression of speed. IMHO if you can remove all the smoke this would be a great shot for a print (challenges don''t really mean that much). *vote watcher?*  that last 1 was a bump :)', '2004-09-16 21:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
