(913793, 105139, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image. I love the colors, and the white, fluffy looking smoke is great. I think perhaps a slightly different angle, one that isolated the peppers and showed more of the smoke, might have been even better. Anyway, it''s really nice and I hope it does well in the voting. Good luck!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a wonderful image. I love the colors, and the white, fluffy looking smoke is great. I think perhaps a slightly different angle, one that isolated the peppers and showed more of the smoke, might have been even better. Anyway, it''s really nice and I hope it does well in the voting. Good luck! ', '2004-09-16 22:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
