(913813, 104940, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is probably getting voted down for being steam rather than smoke, but I think it''s a very nice photo. I''d be interested to know what, if any, post-processing you did on the sky. The peak of the hill (or mountain, depending on where you''re from) appears to be backlit, yet it also looks like there is a shadow of the peak on the clouds. It''s a very interesting look. Anyway, it''s wonderful, and I hope you provide details on the shot. Good luck!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is probably getting voted down for being steam rather than smoke, but I think it''s a very nice photo. I''d be interested to know what, if any, post-processing you did on the sky. The peak of the hill (or mountain, depending on where you''re from) appears to be backlit, yet it also looks like there is a shadow of the peak on the clouds. It''s a very interesting look. Anyway, it''s wonderful, and I hope you provide details on the shot. Good luck! ', '2004-09-16 22:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
