(917253, 104324, 9668, '<td valign="top">I think one reason it may be this far down is it is hard to tell what it is. People (including me) don''t stop long enought to figure out that this is a bubble of smoke from a mouth (suggesting the 100 votes of 5''s and below). Great concept, well executed, but voters didn''t see it. Next time =)</td>', 'I think one reason it may be this far down is it is hard to tell what it is. People (including me) don''t stop long enought to figure out that this is a bubble of smoke from a mouth (suggesting the 100 votes of 5''s and below). Great concept, well executed, but voters didn''t see it. Next time =)', '2004-09-20 01:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
