(917557, 104324, 21714, '<td valign="top">I know you are rather disappointed with your placing. I guess you should be.<br/>There are also people like me who would like to see it placed much higher.<br/>So bigup and show us what you are made of :) <br/>I did see and get what it was and gave it a 9.</td>', 'I know you are rather disappointed with your placing. I guess you should be.There are also people like me who would like to see it placed much higher.So bigup and show us what you are made of :) I did see and get what it was and gave it a 9.', '2004-09-20 03:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(917558, 104803, 14386, '<td valign="top">Great work... I like it though not as much as the out-take that I''ve seen. Congratulations and have fun with your new lens. You''re getting there.<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'Great work... I like it though not as much as the out-take that I''ve seen. Congratulations and have fun with your new lens. You''re getting there. Manny', '2004-09-20 03:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(917562, 103484, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your votes and comments. This was the first thing that jumped to mind when I saw the smoke challenge announced, although I was a little weary of doing something I had already done before. But it paid off and I am happy :)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by markmyshots:</b></div><hr/><i> So, you can blow a bulb by turning it on and off 4 times real fast??? What kind of bulbs do you buy? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What I meant was that if you switch on and off the light very fast the filament doesn''t burn right through, it just burns a little like you see in this image. You can do that about 4 times before the filament blows completely.</td>', 'Thank you all for your votes and comments. This was the first thing that jumped to mind when I saw the smoke challenge announced, although I was a little weary of doing something I had already done before. But it paid off and I am happy :) Originally posted by markmyshots: So, you can blow a bulb by turning it on and off 4 times real fast??? What kind of bulbs do you buy?   What I meant was that if you switch on and off the light very fast the filament doesn''t burn right through, it just burns a little like you see in this image. You can do that about 4 times before the filament blows completely.', '2004-09-20 03:44:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(917563, 103484, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice one Gary. Congrats on your Blue Ribbon</td>', 'Nice one Gary. Congrats on your Blue Ribbon', '2004-09-20 03:45:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(917566, 105072, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congrats Eddy. I was wondering the whole time how you did that. I really thought you had created this effect on the fly. One way of creating more smoke is by putting a bit of oil on the match head before lighting it, it works well!</td>', 'Congrats Eddy. I was wondering the whole time how you did that. I really thought you had created this effect on the fly. One way of creating more smoke is by putting a bit of oil on the match head before lighting it, it works well!', '2004-09-20 03:49:40.000000', NULL, 0),
