(917570, 105014, 5728, '<td valign="top">It a lot of fun to do isn''t it :) I was wondering if anyone else would be doing the same kind of shot, actually I was surprised there was only one other person... Congrats on the greeny :)</td>', 'It a lot of fun to do isn''t it :) I was wondering if anyone else would be doing the same kind of shot, actually I was surprised there was only one other person... Congrats on the greeny :)', '2004-09-20 03:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
