(917876, 105005, 24925, '<td valign="top">Robbed.  This is a great photo and I can''t believe that I''m one of only 6 people that scored it a 9 or 10.<br/> <br/>I''m pleased to see that you''ve already won a few ribbons so hopefully you won''t be tempted to sacrifice the vision with which you took this shot and trade it in for whatever the heck these voters want.<br/> <br/>Very nice photo which tells a great story!</td>', 'Robbed.  This is a great photo and I can''t believe that I''m one of only 6 people that scored it a 9 or 10. I''m pleased to see that you''ve already won a few ribbons so hopefully you won''t be tempted to sacrifice the vision with which you took this shot and trade it in for whatever the heck these voters want. Very nice photo which tells a great story!', '2004-09-20 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(917884, 104564, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skiprow:</b></div><hr/><i> i guess this is another one of those images that contributed to the great ''smoke vs steam'' debates.  i don''t care...this is a great shot.  i, for one, truly appreciate it, because i know how hard it is to be there at that time of day, and how easy it is to miss the shot when you get caught up in the beauty of being there.  great capture.  if you don''t mind, after the challenge, could you also put up the original in your portfolio? </i></td></tr></table><i></i> <br/> <br/>Here is the original unedited picture....<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=106174" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19035/thumb/106174.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19035/thumb/106174.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19035/thumb/106174.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by skiprow: i guess this is another one of those images that contributed to the great ''smoke vs steam'' debates.  i don''t care...this is a great shot.  i, for one, truly appreciate it, because i know how hard it is to be there at that time of day, and how easy it is to miss the shot when you get caught up in the beauty of being there.  great capture.  if you don''t mind, after the challenge, could you also put up the original in your portfolio?   Here is the original unedited picture....', '2004-09-20 09:38:53.000000', NULL, 0),
