(917955, 105014, 18349, '<td valign="top">Believe me when I say this, as I have the UTMOST respect for kiwiness and his photography, but I am really shocked this did not get the blue instead... the shape, form, and depth of this one is just astounding.  What a crime that you didn''t get your 2nd ribbon... but that''s just me bellyaching about it. It''s a beautiful image!  :o)</td>', 'Believe me when I say this, as I have the UTMOST respect for kiwiness and his photography, but I am really shocked this did not get the blue instead... the shape, form, and depth of this one is just astounding.  What a crime that you didn''t get your 2nd ribbon... but that''s just me bellyaching about it. It''s a beautiful image!  :o)', '2004-09-20 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(917956, 105072, 8159, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments everyone!.<br/> <br/>I have to say that terje changed his comment three times during this challenge... his first comment was simply:<br/> <br/><i>EddyG?</i> <br/> <br/>Then, a few days later, he changed it to something like:<br/> <br/><i>EddyG or Kiwiness for sure! Good luck!</i> <br/> <br/>and then a few days after that, he changed it to the "final" version you see below. I thought the whole sequence was pretty funny. I didn''t show this picture to anybody else or tell anyone which entry was mine, so to Terje I say: "good guess!" (and congrats on your ribbon!)<br/> <br/>Thanks again for the nice comments!</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments everyone!. I have to say that terje changed his comment three times during this challenge... his first comment was simply: EddyG?  Then, a few days later, he changed it to something like: EddyG or Kiwiness for sure! Good luck!  and then a few days after that, he changed it to the "final" version you see below. I thought the whole sequence was pretty funny. I didn''t show this picture to anybody else or tell anyone which entry was mine, so to Terje I say: "good guess!" (and congrats on your ribbon!) Thanks again for the nice comments!', '2004-09-20 10:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
