(918030, 104564, 11843, '<td valign="top">Hey Bob,<br/> <br/>I really like your shot. Love the little wisp of steam(smoke) (; rising up off the water and I especially like the sunrays shooting in from the top. Beautiful!<br/> <br/>At least your shot had "Smoke"! LOL  I entered mine(Smoke on the Water) knowing it didn''t have any smoke. Didn''t care, just wanted to submit something. Not particularly happy with any of the challenge topics lately. This was as close as I could get within the time frame. Thanks for the comment.<br/> <br/>Cheers....Martin</td>', 'Hey Bob, I really like your shot. Love the little wisp of steam(smoke) (; rising up off the water and I especially like the sunrays shooting in from the top. Beautiful! At least your shot had "Smoke"! LOL  I entered mine(Smoke on the Water) knowing it didn''t have any smoke. Didn''t care, just wanted to submit something. Not particularly happy with any of the challenge topics lately. This was as close as I could get within the time frame. Thanks for the comment. Cheers....Martin', '2004-09-20 11:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
