(969586, 105039, 2553, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain in taking this shot!  I did a neg spc shot with my husband as my model, and it took some "doing".  The only thing that immediately comes to mind on this shot is, what would it look like in black and white?  I like the concept, and the composition, but find the color distracting.  But then again, I''m a sucker for black and white.</td>', 'I feel your pain in taking this shot!  I did a neg spc shot with my husband as my model, and it took some "doing".  The only thing that immediately comes to mind on this shot is, what would it look like in black and white?  I like the concept, and the composition, but find the color distracting.  But then again, I''m a sucker for black and white.', '2004-10-22 08:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
