(991190, 103484, 1827, '<td valign="top">I perfer your original; I found the smoke more interesting and very pleasing to look at.  Also, although the broken bulb no doubt assisted viewers in  determining what they were looking at, I thought the abstractness of the first one had more appeal.  Great idea - you''re truly an original.</td>', 'I perfer your original; I found the smoke more interesting and very pleasing to look at.  Also, although the broken bulb no doubt assisted viewers in  determining what they were looking at, I thought the abstractness of the first one had more appeal.  Great idea - you''re truly an original.', '2004-11-04 09:39:28.000000', NULL, 0),
