(1085140, 105014, 31311, '<td valign="top">A superb technical photo. Still photography reveals much about nature to me. It is especially good to see here in a moment how particles and heat move. I never get tired of looking at this shot.</td>', 'A superb technical photo. Still photography reveals much about nature to me. It is especially good to see here in a moment how particles and heat move. I never get tired of looking at this shot.', '2005-01-01 07:46:25.000000', NULL, 0),
