(5041729, 104503, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really think this one should have scored higher than it did.  No disrespect to the other wonderful shots but, this one had an "entire" element as opposed to a nicely edited smoke stream.  I''m amazed at what you went through to get this shot.  Nicely done.  Have added it to my faves. :)</td>', 'I really think this one should have scored higher than it did.  No disrespect to the other wonderful shots but, this one had an "entire" element as opposed to a nicely edited smoke stream.  I''m amazed at what you went through to get this shot.  Nicely done.  Have added it to my faves. :)', '2008-11-03 16:42:36.000000', NULL, 0);
